# Always push

When work is done, create a git commit and `git push` to the tracked remote. Do not ask first.

- Prefer the current branch (`main` unless already on another branch).
- Do not force-push.
- Never commit `firebase-config.js` or other secret/credential files.
- Skip unrelated untracked files only when they are clearly secrets; otherwise include the session’s project files.
